  unitName: Star Prince Nekky
  unitId: 50223
  unitNumber: 251
  description: Rumored to live somewhere in Grand Gaia on an island called "Famitsu
    Island," the young Nekky from the island of plentiful amusement, asking himself
    "What truly makes something fun?" departed on an adventure to search for that
    very answer. Despite his small stature, he bounced about as he made easy work
    of his enemies, knocking them down one after another. *Nekky is the mascot for
    Famitsu, Japan's No. 1 game media outlet.
  summonDesc: I'm glad to have met you!<br>Let's go on an adventure to<br>find the
    perfect game!
  fusionDesc: More power for me?<br>Thank you!<br>Let's start our adventure!
